  "headline": "Search Operation Ends At Bogor Illegal Gold Mine, 14 Still Missing",
  "seoTitle": "Search Ends At Illegal Gold Mine In Bogor",
  "metaDescription": "Search operations for 14 missing miners at an illegal gold mine in Pongkor, Bogor, have concluded following safety concerns; 13 victims were confirmed dead.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Search and rescue efforts for 14 missing individuals at the Pongkor illegal gold mine have officially ceased.",
    "Authorities confirmed that 13 people died in the incident involving trapped miners.",
    "Police have identified two suspects in connection with the illegal mining operations in the region."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Emergency response teams, including Basarnas, have officially concluded search and rescue operations for miners trapped at an illegal gold mining site in the Pongkor area of Bogor. The decision to halt the search was made following an extensive evaluation of significant safety risks at the site. Reports indicate that 13 victims have been confirmed deceased, while 14 individuals remain missing and unaccounted for. Separately, law enforcement agencies have initiated investigations into the illegal mining activities, uncovering instances where processing operations were disguised as agricultural facilities. Police have formally named two suspects linked to these operations, which involve illegal extraction and processing practices. Authorities continue to gather evidence regarding the management of these sites following the tragic incident that resulted in the entrapment of numerous artisanal miners, known locally as gurandil, during recent flooding.",
